# Runtime artifacts produced by local tools while RelayX runs.
#
# These are DATA, never source. They must stay out of version control AND out of the paths
# that Tailwind/Vite treat as scanned source: `@tailwindcss/vite` answers a change to any
# scanned file with a `{ type: 'full-reload' }`, which the Vite client turns into
# `location.reload()`. A tool appending to one of these files inside the repo therefore
# reloads the whole renderer and destroys in-memory UI state (this is what made the Add
# Project wizard disappear during ChatGPT planner discovery).
*.jsonl
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm